<Base title="Our Story | Family Recipes Since 1995" description="Discover the family story behind Helena's handmade Polish and Ukrainian pierogies in Kerhonkson, NY.">
<section class="page-hero story-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow light">ROOTED IN FAMILY</span><h1>Made with <em>love.</em><br/>Shared with <em>you.</em></h1></div></section>
<section class="section story-content"><div class="wrap story-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">HOW IT ALL BEGAN</span><h2>A recipe worth <em>sharing.</em></h2><div class="story-image"><img src="/images/pierogi-hero.webp" alt="Golden pierogies served with caramelized onions and sour cream" loading="lazy"/></div></div><div class="story-copy"><p class="lead">Some of the best memories happen around the kitchen table.</p><p>Our story begins with family recipes passed down through our Polish and Ukrainian roots. In 1995, we opened Helena's Specialty Pierogies with one simple hope: to bring traditional European comfort food into more homes.</p><p>We are a family-owned and operated business dedicated to creating handmade pierogies with quality ingredients and care. Every step matters to us—from preparing and rolling the dough to peeling potatoes for the filling and caramelizing onions for our sauce.</p><p>We take pride in sharing food that feels like home, and we do our best to accommodate the people who visit our shop. Every customer is part of the story we're still writing.</p><p>Thank you for supporting our family and helping us keep this delicious tradition alive.</p><div class="story-signoff">Смачного! &nbsp; Smacznego! <span>— The Helena's Family</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="story-values"><div class="wrap value-grid"><div><span>01 /</span><h3>Made by Hand</h3><p>From mixing dough to preparing fillings, thoughtful preparation goes into every batch.</p></div><div><span>02 /</span><h3>Family Traditions</h3><p>Polish and Ukrainian recipes and the comfort of the food we grew up loving.</p></div><div><span>03 /</span><h3>From Our Home to Yours</h3><p>Food that brings people together, one shared meal at a time.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section centered-cta"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">COME EXPERIENCE HELENA'S</span><h2>There's always room at <em>our table.</em></h2><a class="button" href="/visit/">Visit Our Shop ↗</a></div></section>
</Base>
